{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123126","id":4427918941,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABB-yuXQ","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123126","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123126.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123126.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123126","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123126/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123126/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123126/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/f18857fd15bc527261e02672a4a48459348d6539","number":123126,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Implemented type/group filtering in debugger's scene tree","user":{"login":"radioactivejackal1414","id":74024384,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0MDI0Mzg0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/74024384?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/radioactivejackal1414","html_url":"https://github.com/radioactivejackal1414","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radioactivejackal1414/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radioactivejackal1414/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radioactivejackal1414/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radioactivejackal1414/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radioactivejackal1414/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radioactivejackal1414/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radioactivejackal1414/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radioactivejackal1414/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radioactivejackal1414/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\nImplements filtering nodes in the Remote tab of the SceneTreeDock using \"type:\", \"t:\", \"group:\", and \"g\", with functionality mimicked from how SceneTreeEditor does it, so that the Local and Remote tabs in SceneTreeDock are consistent.\r\n\r\n- Closes #79035\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nI expanded `RemoteNode` to carry the information needed for Group and Type filtering, including both native types and custom types. Just like SceneTreeEditor, only persistent groups are shown.\r\n\r\nIf I was reviewing this I'd be concerned about slowdown since `RemoteNode` was expanded and now carries a bunch of strings with it. However I tested this fairly thoroughly with a lot of stress tests including 10,000+ nodes at once, with lots of groups, and experienced no difference or issues with filtering while the project was running.\r\n\r\nThis also uses `.to_lower().contains()` instead of `is_subsequence_ofn` so that Remote and Local both use the same method of filtering, which wasn't the case before and was always odd to me.\r\n","labels":[{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-09-03T00:28:29Z","updated_at":"2026-09-03T13:33:52Z","closed_at":"2026-09-03T07:52:26Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"02ba98dda333d0e278c75a63977319b1b546aacf","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"radioactivejackal1414:remote-filtering","ref":"remote-filtering","repo":{"id":952639608,"node_id":"R_kgDOOMggeA","name":"godot","full_name":"radioactivejackal1414/godot","owner":{"login":"radioactivejackal1414","id":74024384,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0MDI0